<title>JAPAN: TIFFE Euroyen ends sharply down as stocks jump.</title>
<headline>TIFFE Euroyen ends sharply down as stocks jump.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feb 20 settlement  prev settlement</p>
<p> TIFFE Euroyen 3M (Z)     99.23		   99.27</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>The key December three-month Euroyen futures contract ended sharply down on Thursday due to a jump in Tokyo share prices and a sharp fall in Japanese government bond futures.</p>
<p>Traders said a local newspaper report that the government may use public funds to buy land held by loan-collecting bodies triggered a rise in share prices and dragged down Euroyen futures.</p>
</text>
